### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — first baseline
- baseline created over 51 tables — data written BEFORE this point is not covered by it

### 2026-10-17 (UTC) — the snaprows area is unreleased: five record fields become open (a list, a *string) because the restore enforces no bound on them
- MemberEntry.id: wire kind 12 -> 17 [refuse]
- MemberEntry.id: nested table string added [refuse]
- View.state: wire kind 12 -> 17 [refuse]
- View.state: nested table string added [refuse]

